<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-National Foods reports half yr loss.</title>
<headline>RTRS-National Foods reports half yr loss.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     21.72 vs 20.42</p>
<p>    Net				 loss 12.31 vs profit 7.42</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			3.0  vs  3.0</p>
<p>    Abnormals			 loss 36.25 vs loss 4.02</p>
<p>NOTE: National Foods Ltd is a food group. Mingly Corp of Hong Kong holds about 10.4 percent while Singapore group Camerlin Pte Ltd holds about eight percent.  </p>
<p>    Sales				612.50  vs 574.48</p>
<p>    Other income			 5.55  vs   5.80</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		   loss 4.6   vs  profit 3.3</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 14</p>
<p>Reg date April 4</p>
<p>    Tax			    credit 2.24 vs charge 9.03</p>
<p>    Interest				7.39 vs   7.56</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 10.79 vs  10.20</p>
<p>    Minorities (thousands)     charge 10 vs credit 62</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
